              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "vāticinor, vāticinārī — \"to prophesy, to foretell\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vātēs bellum longum vāticinātus est. The seer foretold a long war."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "vāticinor, vāticinārī, vāticinātus sum, a deponent, from vātēs + canō."
            }
          ]
        },
